\v 14 [But I will kindle]{strong=“H3341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w a fire| strong="H784" \w* \w in the wall| strong="H2346" \w* \w of Rabbah| strong="H7237" \w*, [and it shall devour]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the palaces| strong="H759" \w* [thereof, with shouting]{strong=“H8643”} \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of battle| strong="H4421" \w*, \w with a tempest| strong="H5591" \w* \w in the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w of the whirlwind| strong="H5492" \w*: 
